Subject: [PATCH] Sisong 2.16-7: clangd's errors where they can be read

The number of a line clangd faults turns red for an error, amber for a
warning, and the pointer resting on it shows the message. A save lists
the document's errors in the build pane in the compiler's format, so
choosing one goes to its line; the list follows the document and goes
when the errors do. The text goes to clangd a second after editing
pauses, so the marks follow the typing. Before this, diagnostics went to
a box a few characters wide. ProseApps 003e526.

